    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755">

                <pb facs="0849" n="839" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg839"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.6336/11–1348: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-11-23T13:00:00-05:00">November 23,
                            1948—1 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1683. Concur urtel 2199 Nov 13 and Shanghai 2388 Nov 11 pouched Nanking 1806 re
                    Mukden proposal display Communist literature USIS library. Disapprove USIS
                    libraries displaying other Govt’s literature. Principle applies worldwide
                    regardless Govts involved. <pb facs="0850" n="840" xml:id="pg840"/> Assume Emb
                    answering Mukden’s 537 Nov 9 and 564 Nov 13 and transmitting Dept views
                    indicated above and in Deptel 1630 Nov 16.<anchor n="57" xml:id="d755-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
